# Top-level runtime dependencies for the production image.
# Regenerate the lock with:
#   pip-compile --upgrade --strip-extras --output-file requirements-lock.txt requirements.in
# then audit it with:
#   pip-audit -r requirements-lock.txt --extra-index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu
#
# The API only runs sentence-transformer inference on CPU. PyTorch's CPU wheel
# index provides torch builds without the CUDA libraries, which cuts roughly
# 3 GB from the image (the PyPI torch wheel pulls in the nvidia-* packages).
--extra-index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu

